      "Install the Amazon CloudWatch agent on the EC2 instances to collect memory and disk metrics. Set up CloudWatch alarms for the memory and disk thresholds. Configure the CloudWatch alarms to send notifications directly to an Amazon SNS topic, and create a scheduled Amazon EventBridge rule that polls EC2 instance health checks every minute to invoke the AWS Lambda function."
