      "Deploy AWS Global Accelerator in front of the Application Load Balancer (ALB) to accelerate dynamic API traffic. Configure S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) to replicate claim documents to secondary S3 buckets in European and Asian Regions, and use Amazon Route 53 latency-based routing to serve static files.",
