      "Use the AWS Schema Conversion Tool (AWS SCT) to convert the database schema from Microsoft SQL Server to Aurora PostgreSQL. Use AWS Database Migration Service (AWS DMS) with full load plus continuous Change Data Capture (CDC) to migrate existing data and keep the target database in sync until cutover."
