      "Provision an AWS Direct Connect connection and configure a private virtual interface (private VIF) to establish a dedicated, low-latency connection to the VPC.",
      "Establish an AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection between the on-premises customer gateway and the virtual private gateway, using BGP dynamic routing for automatic failover."
