      "Store the API key as an encrypted environment variable in an AWS Lambda function using AWS Key Management Service (AWS KMS). Configure an Amazon EventBridge scheduled rule to invoke a separate Lambda function every 30 days to update the function configuration. Configure an Amazon S3 event notification to invoke the processing Lambda function when new objects are uploaded.",
      "Store the API key in AWS Secrets Manager and configure automatic rotation every 30 days. Configure an Amazon S3 event notification to invoke an AWS Lambda function when new objects are uploaded. Have the Lambda function retrieve the API key from Secrets Manager at runtime to authenticate with the partner service."
