      "Deploy an AWS Transit Gateway and attach both the Production VPC and the Agency Records VPC. Assign Elastic IP addresses to the EC2 instances in the private subnets, and configure the private route tables with a default route (0.0.0.0/0) pointing to an Internet Gateway for outbound internet access and inter-VPC traffic.",
      "Deploy a NAT Gateway in a public subnet of the Production VPC with a route to an Internet Gateway. Establish a VPC peering connection between the Production VPC and the Agency Records VPC. Update the Production VPC private route tables with a route for 10.20.0.0/16 pointing to the VPC peering connection and a 0.0.0.0/0 route pointing to the NAT Gateway, and add a route for 10.10.0.0/16 pointing to the VPC peering connection in the Agency Records VPC route tables.",
