      "Create a Gateway VPC Endpoint in the Production VPC configured with routes to the Agency Records VPC. Deploy an Internet Gateway attached to the private subnets of the Production VPC. Update the Security Groups of the EC2 instances to allow inbound traffic from 0.0.0.0/0 for downloading patches and outbound traffic to 10.20.0.0/16 via the Gateway Endpoint."
