      "In the public subnet Network Access Control List (NACL), add an inbound DENY rule for 198.51.100.0/24 with a lower rule number than the allow rule. In the private subnet NACL, add an inbound rule allowing port 3306 and specify the web application tier's security group ID as the source.",
