      "Deploy an AWS DataSync agent on an on-premises virtual machine. Configure a DataSync task with bandwidth throttling to transfer the entire 80 TB baseline data and schedule daily incremental sync tasks to Amazon S3.",
      "Order multiple AWS Snowball Edge Storage Optimized devices for the initial 80 TB data transfer to Amazon S3. Provision a dedicated AWS Direct Connect connection and configure cron jobs with AWS CLI `s3 sync` to transfer the daily delta files."
