      "Deploy the containers on Amazon ECS using the AWS Fargate launch type. Specify an IAM role in the ECS task definition (ECS task role) that grants permissions to access the S3 bucket. Configure an S3 Lifecycle rule on the bucket to abort incomplete multipart uploads after 7 days and transition objects to S3 Standard-IA after 90 days."
