      "Attach an IAM role to the EC2 instances in Account A with permissions to assume a role in Account B. In Account B, create an IAM role with an IAM policy granting write access to the S3 bucket and a trust policy that allows Account A to assume the role. Configure the application to assume the Account B role.",
      "Configure an S3 bucket Access Control List (ACL) on the bucket in Account B to grant write permissions to the AWS Account A ID. Attach an IAM role to the EC2 instances with AmazonS3FullAccess permissions and upload objects directly using the instance profile."
