    question_en: "A media company runs a global video streaming platform that stores high-resolution master video files in Amazon S3 buckets. During a recent deployment, an administrative IAM role inadvertently altered the S3 bucket policies and security configurations, temporarily exposing private video assets and disrupting transcoding workflows.\n\nThe company requires a solution to continuously track all management API calls across the AWS environment for compliance auditing, identifying who made the request and when. Additionally, the security operations team must receive near real-time alerts whenever critical S3 configuration changes (such as PutBucketPolicy or DeleteBucketPolicy) occur.\n\nWhich solution should the solutions architect recommend to meet these requirements?",
