    question_en: "A company has multiple applications generating a continuous stream of application logs. The company needs a solution to ingest these logs and make them available for near-real-time full-text search and interactive operational dashboards. In addition, all raw log data must be durably stored for long-term compliance, with older log files automatically transitioned to lower-cost storage after 90 days. The architecture should require minimal operational overhead and avoid managing infrastructure or custom consumer code.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
