    question_en: "An organization needs to transfer daily backup files from its on-premises data center to an Amazon S3 bucket. Each backup file is approximately 50 GB in size. The organization requires a secure, encrypted-in-transit hybrid network connection that can be established within a few hours at minimal cost. Furthermore, the transfer process must maximize throughput by uploading data parts in parallel and be resilient to transient network drops by retrying only failed components.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
