    question_en: "A company is developing a serverless application that allows users around the world to upload large data files of up to 5 GB each. The application also needs to store and query file metadata with single-digit millisecond latency. The application experiences unpredictable and spiky traffic patterns. The architecture must avoid routing large file uploads through backend compute infrastructure and minimize operational overhead.\n\nWhich combination of actions should a solutions architect recommend to meet these requirements? (Choose two.)",
