      "Deploy an Auto Scaling group across a single Availability Zone using 100% Spot Instances for all compute capacity, and attach an Application Load Balancer with dynamic step scaling policies.",
      "Deploy an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones configured exclusively with On-Demand Instances to handle both baseline and peak traffic, and configure scheduled scaling policies based on estimated hourly load.",
      "Deploy a single large EC2 instance with maximum capacity in one Availability Zone, and use AWS Lambda to vertically scale the instance size whenever CPU utilization exceeds a target threshold."
