      "Deploy an AWS Direct Connect connection with a public virtual interface (VIF) to access the private VPC workloads. Establish a static route-based AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection to handle active-active load balancing.",
      "Deploy two separate AWS Direct Connect connections from the on-premises data center terminating at different Direct Connect locations with private virtual interfaces (VIFs), and use dynamic BGP routing across both links.",
      "Set up two redundant AWS Site-to-Site VPN connections over the public internet terminating on a Virtual Private Gateway (VGW), and configure Equal-Cost Multi-Path (ECMP) routing for high availability."
