      "Deploy an Application Load Balancer across multiple Availability Zones that routes traffic to an Auto Scaling group of Amazon EC2 instances spanning multiple Availability Zones with a target tracking scaling policy. Configure the database on an Amazon RDS for MySQL DB instance in a single Availability Zone with automated snapshot backups retained for 35 days."
