      "Deploy the EC2 instances in private subnets across both Availability Zones. Deploy a NAT Gateway in a public subnet in each Availability Zone, and configure each private subnet's route table with a 0.0.0.0/0 route pointing to the NAT Gateway in its respective Availability Zone. Route both outbound internet API traffic and Amazon S3 traffic directly through the NAT Gateways."
