      "Create a VPC with public subnets, private application subnets, and private database subnets across two Availability Zones. Attach an Internet Gateway and deploy the ALB and NAT Gateways in the public subnets with a route to the Internet Gateway. Deploy the EC2 instances in the private application subnets with route tables directing outbound internet traffic to the NAT Gateways. Deploy the Multi-AZ RDS database in a DB subnet group spanning the private database subnets with only local VPC routes.",
      "Create a VPC with public subnets and private subnets across two Availability Zones. Attach an Egress-Only Internet Gateway to the VPC for IPv4 traffic. Deploy the ALB in the public subnets and the EC2 instances in the private subnets. Configure the private subnets to route 0.0.0.0/0 to the Egress-Only Internet Gateway. Create a DB subnet group in a single Availability Zone for the RDS database."
