      "Configure Amazon S3 Event Notifications to send object creation events to an Amazon Simple Queue Service (Amazon SQS) standard queue. Configure an AWS Lambda function with the SQS queue as an event source to process the files, and configure an SQS dead-letter queue (DLQ) to isolate messages that fail processing.",
