      "Configure an S3 Lifecycle policy to transition objects to S3 One Zone-Infrequent Access (S3 One Zone-IA) after 30 days, transition objects to S3 Glacier Deep Archive after 90 days, and create an AWS Lambda function invoked by Amazon EventBridge to scan and delete incomplete multipart uploads.",
      "Configure an S3 Lifecycle policy to transition objects to S3 Standard-Infrequent Access (S3 Standard-IA) after 30 days, transition objects to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 90 days, and set an action to abort incomplete multipart uploads after 7 days."
