      "Use AWS Snowball Edge Storage Optimized devices to migrate the initial 40 TB video archive to Amazon S3 Standard. Write a custom script on the on-premises server that uses the AWS CLI with Amazon S3 Transfer Acceleration to upload daily recordings. Configure an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects to Amazon S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 90 days.",
