      "Deploy the worker applications on Amazon EC2 Spot Instances with an IAM user's access keys stored in the instance user data. Store the processed telemetry in an Amazon DynamoDB table configured with Provisioned capacity mode, and use a scheduled AWS Lambda function to scan and delete items older than 90 days.",
