    question_en: "A company runs a stateless web application on AWS that must operate 24/7. The application has a predictable, steady baseline traffic load throughout the day, but experiences sudden, unpredictable traffic spikes during business hours. The architecture must be highly available, fault-tolerant against Availability Zone failures, and optimized for compute costs.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements MOST cost-effectively?",
