      "Scale up the primary RDS DB instance to a larger compute-optimized instance class and take automated manual snapshots every 15 minutes to process reporting queries.",
      "Create an Amazon RDS Read Replica for the database. Configure the dashboard and reporting applications to send read-only queries to the read replica endpoint while continuing to send write traffic to the primary DB instance endpoint."
