      "Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones. Retain the Amazon RDS for MySQL DB instance and manually provision additional RDS read replicas during sales events, while configuring Amazon ElastiCache for Memcached to store database connection objects."
