    question_en: "A company requires an automated solution to process data files that are periodically uploaded to an Amazon S3 bucket. Each file takes less than 30 seconds to process, and the extracted data must be written to an Amazon DynamoDB table. The solution must minimize operational overhead and adhere to security best practices by eliminating the use of long-lived credentials.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
