      "Deploy an Application Load Balancer across multiple Availability Zones. Configure an Auto Scaling group that spans subnets in multiple Availability Zones. Configure a scheduled scaling policy to adjust capacity at fixed intervals and rely on default EC2 status checks for health monitoring."
