      "Attach an Amazon EBS io2 Block Express volume to Amazon EC2 Spot instances using EBS Multi-Attach within a partition placement group, and stream the dataset directly from Amazon S3 to the EBS volume during processing.",
      "Deploy an Amazon FSx for Lustre file system linked to the Amazon S3 bucket, and run the processing jobs on Amazon EC2 Spot instances launched in a cluster placement group, exporting the results back to Amazon S3."
